//   - `runner.config.json` → `gates.complexity` → `npx eslint --no-config-lookup`
//   - `eslint.config.gate.mjs` → the runner's MID-RUN lint gate, which extends this file
//   - `tools/hooks/post-ts-edit.sh` → `eslint --fix` on every edited `.ts`
// Without it every one of those spawns exits "couldn't find eslint.config.*",
// which the runner's format gate reads as a real, non-advancing gate failure.
